    <node id="范蠡">
      <data key="d0">范蠡</data>
      <data key="d1">人物</data>
      <data key="d2">范蠡 is a notable historical figure recognized as a strategist and advisor to King Goujian of the Yue state during the Spring and Autumn period of Chinese history. Originally from the state of Chu, he was skilled in swordsmanship and played a significant role in various military and diplomatic endeavors. His expertise in sword-making and his involvement in sword competitions highlight his martial prowess and dedication to the craft.

As a counselor to Goujian, 范蠡 was deeply engaged in strategic discussions and decision-making processes, contributing to the Yue state's efforts against its rivals, particularly the Wu state. His character is often depicted as thoughtful and resourceful, adept at navigating complex situations, which made him a valuable asset in both military and diplomatic contexts.

In addition to his military contributions, 范蠡 is portrayed as a compassionate individual, willing to assist others, including a character named A Qing and her mother. His relationships with various characters, including friends and allies, illustrate his supportive nature and the personal connections he maintained throughout his life.

Overall, 范蠡's legacy is marked by his strategic acumen, martial skills, and his role as a loyal advisor, making him a significant figure in the historical narrative of the Yue state and its conflicts with Wu.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
