    <edge source="阿青" target="范蠡">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 范蠡 (Fan Li) and 阿青 (A Qing) is characterized by a deep friendship and mutual care. 范蠡 demonstrates his concern for 阿青 by offering to compensate her for a lost sheep, indicating his willingness to support her in times of need. In return, 阿青 expresses her gratitude towards 范蠡, praising him as a good person and acknowledging his kindness.

Their relationship is further illustrated by 范蠡's active involvement in 阿青's life; he accompanies her while she tends to her sheep and takes the opportunity to learn her swordsmanship. This not only highlights his interest in her well-being but also suggests a desire to bond through shared activities. 阿青, in turn, harbors feelings for 范蠡, which adds a layer of emotional depth to their friendship.

范蠡's protective nature is evident as he prioritizes 阿青's safety, reinforcing the notion that their connection is built on trust and affection. Additionally, 阿青's strong feelings for 范蠡 are emphasized by her declaration that he is the most cherished person in her heart. 

However, the dynamic is complicated by 阿青's threatening behavior towards 西施 (Xi Shi), which may indicate underlying tensions or conflicts that could affect her relationship with 范蠡. Despite this, the overall portrayal of 范蠡 and 阿青's relationship is one of mutual respect, affection, and a strong bond of friendship.</data>
      <data key="d9">修炼,情感,敌对</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-013870c1938481d1558d4c2e439c83d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66</data>
